#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/spec_blueprint.rst:4
msgid "Kubernetes Spec Blueprint"
msgstr "Blueprint Kubernetes Spec"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/spec_blueprint.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/spec_blueprint.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Kubernetes Spec blueprint type allows deploying raw Kubernetes YAML "
"manifests as |morpheus| Apps. Unlike Helm charts which use templating, "
"Kubernetes Spec blueprints deploy standard Kubernetes resource "
"definitions directly. This is managed by the "
"``KubernetesAppTemplateService``."
msgstr "Le type de blueprint Kubernetes Spec permet de déployer des manifestes YAML Kubernetes bruts en tant qu'Apps |morpheus|. Contrairement aux charts Helm qui utilisent la modélisation, les blueprints Kubernetes Spec déploient directement des définitions de ressources Kubernetes standard. Ceci est géré par le ``KubernetesAppTemplateService``."

